Node ID=1 Conversation Start
Text=Welcome, senor, to Quinn's Apothecary, providing tonics and potions to all Nueva Barcelona for twenty years - and God willing, twenty more. Please, tell me what ails you, and we will see what I have that may help.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Herbalist Player has Convince Herbalist Turn Dark
Reply Text=Relican and I ask you to embrace the Dark Powers of Necromancy.
Go to node ID=700 relican
Action work in progress=(Quest from Relican to turn Quinn to Dark Wielders)
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=Herbalist if davinci told you about wielders AND Speech 25
