}
}
}
Reply Text=A mutual friend, Signor Leo, recommended that I speak to you...about a certain faction within the city that has been wrongfully persecuted?
Go to node ID=101 Wielders Good
Action work in progress=(If spoken with Davinci about Wielders, Speech >=25%)
Icon=Speach Skill Icon

Requirement=herbalist if wererats asked you to get cure
Reply Text=I need a cure for someone not completely turned into one of the Afflicted.
Go to node ID=350 wererat cure
Action work in progress=(If you have been told to find a cure for the Wererats)
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Very well. Can I see what you have for sale?
Go to node ID=20 Potions response if not Inquisitor
Action work in progress=If How make Potions NOT Explained

Requirement=Speech moreequal 25
Reply Text=You've been in Barcelona for twenty years? You must know a great deal about what goes on in the city.
Go to node ID=40 City News
Action work in progress=(Speech>=25%)
Icon=Speach Skill Icon

Requirement=Speech lessthan 025
Reply Text=Can I ask you some questions about Barcelona?
Go to node ID=40 City News
Action work in progress=(Speech<25%)

Requirement=Herbalist if davinci told you about wielders
Reply Text=Signor Leo told me you know something about the Wielders.
Go to node ID=100 Wielders
